{"version":1,"content":"<p>彭博社近日報道，<strong>保時捷CEO駱明楷（Michael Leiters）在柏林的一場行業會議上，公開點評特斯拉全新Roadster超跑的「空中飛車」演示，直言保時捷不會效仿這種表演式發佈</strong>。他表示：「我們不想搞任何特效或表演，保時捷希望展示真實可落地的技術創新。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586056.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:44:30.452276+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:25:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_hash":"3c73bd45f15379f617a4a4946a3c04ae9f2a86f47f219ff76531851236a4ad10","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}